bin/
obj/
out/

# Windows installer build output (.github/workflows/release-windows.yml and
# installer/CLeARINET.iss): the dotnet publish payload and Inno Setup's own
# compiled setup.exe, both easily 50-100+ MB and neither meant to be
# committed -- CI produces these fresh on every tagged release and attaches
# the installer to the GitHub Release itself, not to the repository.
/publish/
/installer/Output/

